his fits with the rest of the platform, and [Deploying and Releasing](../docs/deploy.md#cms-components) for version-pinning/compatibility notes when consuming this package from elsewhere in the monorepo.\n\n## Scripts\n\n- `build` / `build:prod` / `build:watch` — builds the package\n- `build-types` — generates TypeScript type declarations\n- `docs:field-types` — generates field-type documentation\n- `test` / `test:watch` — vitest\n- `publint` — validates the published package shape before release\n","readmeFilename":"README.md"}